    "calendar.episodeShort" : {
      "comment" : "Abbreviated episode label on a small card: on the Roku Calendar screen, and on Android phone and TV episode cards when the season number is unknown (Android pads to two digits). Apple iOS, tvOS and macOS use it in the video player title and info overlay when an episode has an episode number but no season number. {episode}: the episode number. Apple iOS and macOS: a downloaded episode's tag in Downloads rows, on its offline page and in the Free Up Space sheet when only the episode number is known, the code of an episode row in an expanded downloaded series, and the code in the offline play button of a special (Play E3). Roku also uses it on episode cards when the season number is unknown (padded to two digits).",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
