    "cast.replace.profileWatching" : {
      "comment" : "Android phone: Remote Control \"Replace what's playing?\" dialog; message when another profile's title is on the TV. {profile}: that profile's name; {title}: the title, such as Season 1 · Oak Street; {tv}: the TV's name. Apple iOS: Remote Control \"Replace What's Playing?\" alert message.",
