    "catalog.episodeCaption" : {
      "comment" : "Episode caption, such as S2 · E5, with a middle dot separator: on Roku cards, in the Android TV player Info panel above the episode title (shown in capitals), and as the season and episode line in the Apple iOS, tvOS and macOS video player's info overlay and Remote Control state. {season}: the season number; {episode}: the episode number. Apple iOS and macOS: the season and episode of a downloaded episode in Downloads rows, in the downloads Live Activity and in the background download progress, and as the code in the This Episode row of the series Download sheet (S1 · E2 · Pilot, joined to the title through detail.episodeCard.title). Roku also uses it after the episode title in the player's title line and Info tab.",
