    "catalog.episodeTag" : {
      "comment" : "Compact episode tag, such as S2E5 (Android pads each number to two digits: S02E05), on Roku, Android phone and Android TV cards and the Android TV Home hero. On Android phone it also appears in a download's subtitle and progress notification, and in the media notification after the series name, such as Severance - S02E04. On Apple iOS, tvOS and macOS it is the season and episode code in the video player's title line (series • S2E5 • episode title), also on the lock screen. {season}: the season number; {episode}: the episode number. Android phone and TV title pages: the code before the episode title under an episode card (S01E02). Apple iOS, tvOS and macOS also show it padded to two digits (S01E02) on episode cards in Home rows, library and search grids and a series page's episode rail, and in the Apple TV Top Shelf after the series name (Severance · S2E5); the Downloads Free Up Space sheet shows it unpadded after the series name.",
