    "collections.rowKindCount" : {
      "comment" : "Apple iOS and tvOS: subtitle of a user collection row in the Collections list, giving its kind and size. {count}: the number of items, which selects the plural. {count_text}: the same number as digits. {kind}: the collection kind from the server, capitalized, such as Manual or Smart, or Custom when it has none.",
