    "companion.progressAllowSetup" : {
      "comment" : "Apple (iPhone, iPad) nearby-TV pairing card: progress text while the TV asks its viewer to allow the setup. {tv}: the TV's name as it advertises itself (for example Living Room). {model}: the device model the person is holding, as the system names it (iPhone or iPad; not translated).",
