      "comment" : "Home card subtitle (Roku) and Home marquee line (Apple tvOS) for an episode. {season}: the season number; {episode}: the episode number. S and E abbreviate Season and Episode. Apple iOS and macOS: the first fact on a downloaded episode's offline page.",
