    "pin.lockout.minutes" : {
      "comment" : "Apple (iPhone, iPad, Mac, Apple TV): error on the PIN prompt after too many wrong PINs, saying how long the profile stays locked. Plural counts the minutes (up to 1440). {count}: the number of minutes; {count_text}: the same number as text.",
