    "player.subtitleSync.failureGeneric" : {
      "comment" : "Apple iOS/tvOS/macOS: why a subtitle sync failed when the server gave no known reason, in the sync card and under the timing actions. Shown under the selected subtitle's timing actions in the player: the iOS Audio & Subtitles sheet, the macOS player options panel and the tvOS info panel's Subtitles tab. Android phone and TV player subtitle timing: same reason under the timing actions and on the sync card.",
