    "player.subtitleSync.forbiddenOwner" : {
      "comment" : "Apple iOS/tvOS/macOS: replaces the timing actions after an older server refused them for this profile. Shown under the selected subtitle's timing actions in the player: the iOS Audio & Subtitles sheet, the macOS player options panel and the tvOS info panel's Subtitles tab.",
