    "settings.connection.budget" : {
      "comment" : "Help text in connection settings explaining Auto quality plays videos without transcoding up to a speed. {rate}: the speed, such as 12 Mbps. Apple Settings > Playback (iPhone, iPad, Mac) and Apple TV Settings > Playback: footer under the connection speed row.",
