    "settings.connection.duringPlayback" : {
      "comment" : "Connection Speed line for a speed reached while playing a video, which is a minimum. {rate}: the speed, such as 20 Mbps; {age}: how long ago, such as 2 hours ago. Apple Settings > Playback (iPhone, iPad, Mac) and Apple TV Settings > Playback: line under Connection speed.",
