    "settings.quality.footerBitrate" : {
      "comment" : "Apple Settings > Playback (iPhone, iPad, Mac) and Apple TV Settings > Playback: sentence added to the quality footer when a Maximum Bitrate is chosen. Android phone and TV Settings > Playback: the same sentence, under the Resolution and Maximum Bitrate pickers.",
