    "settings.search.iosTerms.about" : {
      "comment" : "Apple Settings overview (iPhone, iPad): comma-separated search keywords that make Settings search show the About group. Keep the commas between terms; matching ignores case and finds any term containing the typed text. Translate each term as people would search for it in your language. These add to the English keywords, which always match too; never shown on screen.",
