      "comment" : "Apple Settings > Sign-in > Connect (iPhone, iPad, Mac): note under the Silo password when connecting a network provider such as Tailscale, which knows who owns this device; the password stops working afterwards. {owner}: the device owner's name at the provider; {provider}: the provider's name.",
