    "signIn.error.networkEmailInUse" : {
      "comment" : "Android phone sign-in screen: error after Continue as … when an account with the same email already exists but isn't connected to the network provider. 1: the network provider's name, such as Tailscale. Settings → Sign-in names the app's own Settings screens. Apple (iPhone, iPad, Mac, Apple TV): same network sign-in error.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يوجد حساب ببريدك الإلكتروني بالفعل. سجّل الدخول بكلمة المرور، ثم اربط %1$@ من الإعدادات ← تسجيل الدخول."
