    "signIn.error.passwordOff" : {
      "comment" : "Roku and Android phone sign-in screen: error, or a note under the provider buttons on the phone, when the server has turned off password sign-in. Apple (iPhone, iPad, Mac, Apple TV): same text as a note under provider buttons and as a sign-in error.",
