    "signIn.error.passwordOffUseProvider" : {
      "comment" : "Android phone sign-in screen: error after a password sign-in when the server turned password sign-in off. 1: the server's sign-in provider's name, such as Google. Apple (iPhone, iPad, Mac): same sign-in error when one provider is offered.",
