    "watchParty.hint.everyoneReady" : {
      "comment" : "Roku: hint line in the lobby when all members have marked ready. Apple (iPhone, iPad, Apple TV): same hint under the lobby's buttons. Android phone and TV Watch Party lobby: same line under the host's buttons.",
