    "watchParty.hint.noVotes" : {
      "comment" : "Roku: hint line in the voting lobby when there are suggestions but no votes. Apple (iPhone, iPad, Apple TV): same hint under the lobby's buttons. Android phone and TV Watch Party lobby: same line under the host's buttons.",
